    "prompt": "If $n!=n\\times(n-1)\\times(n-2)\\times\\cdots\\times1$, then the number of perfect squares in the infinite sequence\n$$1!,\\ 1!+2!,\\ 1!+2!+3!,\\ \\ldots,\\ 1!+2!+3!+4!+\\cdots+n!,\\ \\ldots$$\nis",
    "image": null,
    "choices": [
