      }
    ],
    "answer": "A",
    "acceptedAnswers": null,
    "answerUnit": null,
    "solutions": [
      {
        "title": "Bound the smallest",
        "body": "$\\frac1a>\\frac1b>\\frac1c$, so $\\frac1a>\\frac13$, hence $a<3$; and $\\frac1a<1$ so $a>1$: $a=2$. Then $\\frac1b+\\frac1c=\\frac12$ with $\\frac1b>\\frac14$ and $\\frac1b<\\frac12$, so $b=3$ and $c=6$.\n\n**Answer: (A) 6**"
